			<div class="content" id="post-content-2427100">
									

<p>I'll admit that while this hinges mostly on the log at the end, I thought it amusing and reminiscent enough of my experiences with bootlegged games and text adventures that it won me over. The article being as short as it is helps with it too. While I think you could expand on the possible connections between SCP-2527-1 and -2 (and I do encourage you to do so), being too in-depth or explanatory about it would probably weaken the article, as taking away a good amount of mystery would hurt the quality.</p>
<p>I do think it's a worthwhile angle to explore if you continue to update the article, and see how to strengthen it, as it can come off as being disparate and unrelated (and I assume you have an idea of why these two are connected). As a whole though, it amuses me and the log absolutely made it for me.</p>

							</div>

								
